      83'2 / Access violation 0x83E6B9 v.addr:0x14 Main.cpp:2407. Crashing+respawning
      is fine; only land->exit-to-HQ CTDs. Needs Ghidra on 0x83E6B9 (what it reads at
      +0x14 on exit) - likely a null field/mission pointer that a real ground-start
