      exactly when the plane is still (23137,61949,47915 in all three consecutive
      frames). So the movement reading is REAL: this 'landed' air-start plane is
      still transmitting flight-magnitude position changes. Working hypothesis: an
      air-start 'landing' (StartGround=no, StartAirfield=-1) is not a client-
      recognised field-park - the plane never enters the parked-at-field state - which
      would explain BOTH the never-zero movement AND the HQ-return CTD below.
      * ADDED (read-only, no behaviour change): _pos_hist samples now carry their
