v481f5 [RESUPPLY - REVERT v480f5 SPAWN SKIP: IT CTD'd ON GROUND IMPACT] The
      v480f5 'part 2' (skip the msg-60 spawn grant in air-start arenas, on the
      premise that air-start planes come up fuelled/armed) was WRONG and crashed
