        rooms + room_players rows; every removal logged [CLEANUP].
      * CORRECTION (this entry, later the same session): the 'LATENT BUG'
        originally filed here was MY misreading - the row form and the
        settings form post to SEPARATE endpoints (/admin/edit_arena vs
        /admin/arena_settings), each writing only its own fields; no
