      FUN_100032da, pre-section, all accepted datagrams; bytes = 0x1c + len
      each) and FUN_100073a4 computes COMBINED bidirectional loss from our
      wire[12-23] + its own counters. Old sess.sq/sess.rx ticked in reliable-
      seq units the client never counts -> diff clamped 0 forever -> D: dead.
      * TX at ONE choke point no send site can bypass: _CountingSock, a thin
        delegating proxy around the UDP socket (socket method slots are
        READ-ONLY on Windows - the sendto monkeypatch AttributeErrors; proxy
        delegates recvfrom/setsockopt/bind/fileno via __getattr__). RX at
        on_pkt's single door.
      * TEST_DROP_PCT: test-only loss injector (counts as sent, does not
        transmit; entered_game-gated - NOTE 40% starves the world-state
        download and blocks arena entry; test in the 5-15% range). NEVER
        deploy >0. Deployed value confirmed 0.0.
      * (Counter SEMANTICS wrong in this take - cumulative vs the client's
        per-interval; fixed in v468.)

