      base + A/1000 (v205) and FUN_10007d13 advances base by exactly our
      STATUS credits (v215). So the coherent A is the RESIDUAL - elapsed-
      since-connect MINUS ms already credited - bounded [0, ~2.2s] forever,
      NEVER wraps by construction, reduces to the field-proven v211 elapsed
      formula in the lobby (credits 0). The -28.93s poison sample of
      run_215056 was the mod-262.144 ALIAS of exactly this elapsed-vs-
      credited mismatch (1024s mod 262.144 = 237.4s = -28.9+262.1, less the
      pre-STATUS gap) - the measurement that proves the model. Credits
