      latched current-status-index cycles through 511 it EQUALS
      build_time_reply's 0x1FF constant for one 2s window -> the v459
      'never match in-game' guard silently unlocks -> a poisoned NTP sample
      is ACCEPTED (22:08:25.665 Sample 14, offset -28.93s = the base-vs-A
      divergence) -> slew -> CRAP meltdown 20s later (22:08:45), per client,
