      perfect: wrap at 22:08:24-26 per the Current-Status-Index trail 6,7,8
      by :39-:44. FIX: never advertise seq 511 (skip 0x1FF in the
      increment) - in-game index lives in 0..510, the lobby constant can
      never match mid-game, sessions of ANY length. Kept as defense-in-depth
      after v465/466 (the echo mirrors the seq, 0x1FF unreachable anyway).
      Lesson: 'reply with an index that never matches' was only sound while
      the index space was one frozen value - v460 made it CYCLE.

