v460f5 [STATUS SEQ GATE - L: AND THE SESSION TIMER, ALIVE SINCE 2009]
      HUD L: static forever: vcncnet FUN_100076c2 GATES ALL STATUS
      processing on the sequence CHANGING - and reads that sequence from
      the LOW 9 BITS of ntohs(wire bytes 2-3): seq = ((wire2&1)<<8)|wire3.
      Our packet left wire3=0 -> seq 0 forever -> ONE processing event per
      session (= the one-time +2.001s base step seen in run_203008) and a
      frozen ConnectionStatus. Dispatcher geometry decoded en route (code
      offsets = wire+4; section cursor; payload at wire 8 - the v215 base_
      incr/counter offsets were ALREADY CORRECT). FIX: two bytes - seq low 8
      into wire3, bit 8 into wire2 bit0 (dispatcher never tests 0x01).
      VERIFIED 31.5-min run: 370 processings, seq marching, session timer
      counting, L: updating (with values = dup-ACK extend-factor multiples
      of true RTT - the RTT_SAMPLING item; DAT_10020360 is the L: source via
      FUN_100073a4 param_3, chain decompiled). SIDE EFFECT: armed the
      seq-511 bomb (v463) - the client's index space now cycles.

