      [aa_offset-5, same location as the serve patch, 4 [AI]-bool guard] ->
      fa_compress -> round-trip verify (decompress==patched or LEAVE
      UNCHANGED) -> UPDATE rooms). Idempotent (rooms already 0 skipped),
      fully guarded per-row, gated by APPLY_REPAIR_RATE_MIGRATION. Every
      future serve now starts from a correct blob, AND a client that drops
      its cache re-fetches the corrected value. NOTE for the field: the
      client must still be restarted to discard its cached GAME_DEF; the
      server migration alone cannot reach an already-cached client.
