      and can never drift from the code - values shown are the EFFECTIVE ones (blank-TC
      planes show their FFA fallback). (2) Arena settings editor: new 'Scoring mode' dropdown
      -> settings_json 'scoring_mode': Default (the category decides; the effective result is
      shown inline in the option label), Force FFA, Force TC, or Force NO global scoring.
      scoring_mode_for_room() checks the override FIRST, so it wins over the category; ''/
