      its category/list grouping. (3) /ladder gained a military-rank column (rank name
      computed from score against the injected ladder); the position column is now '#'.
      The pilot editor already edits rank (0-12) and every score column (v240) - with the
      v401f5 13-rank ladder those indices now map to the full Cadet..FM range.
      Unit-verified: override precedence (override beats category, 'none' forces off, junk
      falls through, custom-can-be-forced-on), web_scoring_reference structure (13 ranks,
