      ROLLBACK: previous build is v377f5 (this session). server.py.bak and
      server-fable5-v362f5-stable.py remain on disk as older fallbacks. FALSIFY: open the hangar on
      each side at INFO - the POST-AUTH 'catalog filtered' line still fires, and now each side shows
