      (3) Re-stamp structural guard: pack_into only when len(relayed) >= 9 - the
          struct.error class is impossible regardless of future wrapper forms.
      NOTE: wrapped DAMAGE28 unwraps to the direct frame, so the v352 in-branch
      prefix-strip does not double-fire (_dmg_ok passes on the unwrapped form).

